Port from openclaw/openclaw#112954. The redactor knew GitHub, Slack,
Google, Stripe, AWS access-key-ID and ~25 other vendor prefixes but had
zero GitLab coverage — glpat-/gloas-/gldt-/glrt-/glrtr-/glcbt-/glptt-/
