 .github/workflows/ci.yml                  | 13 ++++++++++---
 scripts/ci/classify_changes.py            | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 tests/ci/test_classify_changes.py         | 22 +++++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

